  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Time_on_Display/BH_TOD_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"450\"></span></strong></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">習慣全螢幕玩Minecraft嗎？相信你一定有過需要查看手機或跳出全螢幕確認時間的經驗。別擔心，現在只要按下F8單一按鍵，就能在遊戲中直接顯示時間！此外還能查看遊戲內時間，輕鬆掌握日夜交替與日出時刻。超方便的！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友共用的伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Time_on_Display/BH_TOD_promo.webp\" width=\"1200\" height=\"250\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">若您正在尋找能與朋友遊玩各類模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>正是最佳選擇！他們提供性價比最高的Minecraft伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼「Lupin」即可享75折優惠。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Time_on_Display/BH_TOD_summary.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">全螢幕遊玩時總要拿手機看時間？Time On Display正是為您打造的解決方案，只需按下F8鍵（可自訂）即可顯示當前時間。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不僅能顯示現實時間，還會同步展示Minecraft遊戲內時間，所有顯示位置與設定皆可自由調整。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Time_on_Display/BH_TOD_faq.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"150\"></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支援伺服器使用嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！記得與朋友遊玩模組的最佳選擇就是BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結可享75折優惠</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模組可加入模組包嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限發布於Modrinth或CurseForge平台。上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，嚴格禁止此類行為。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若您考慮將本模組加入Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們將不勝感激。如有任何調整需求或疑問，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以錄製模組遊玩影片上傳頻道嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然歡迎！您可以在頻道中自由遊玩本模組或我們的模組包並製作影片，我們對此深表感謝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Time_on_Display/BH_TOD_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"150\">